## Same-window browser comparison (performed by the main session)

Edge, same window at DPR 1.25. 2K, 4K, 8K, then a revisit to 2K all loaded. One local sample measured 54/79/255/17 ms before and 54/63/258/20 ms after; these samples do not establish a load-speed improvement. Thirty synchronous view changes produced 90 UI callbacks before and 1 after. Eight animation frames over 56 ms advanced autorotation by 0.10 degrees. A bad image rejected, then a valid image loaded; same-tick selection kept the latest request; dispose left zero canvases. Console and widget demo images loaded; console PSV→legacy→PSV had one canvas per engine switch; manual zoom stopped autorotation.

Timing samples are single local observations, not a performance claim.

